-- THE HAND-OVER. The provision that lets the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of personal data for bias detection and correction:
-- as enacted it is Article 10(5) (Chapter III Section 2), as amended Article 4a(1) (Chapter I). "such systems" are high-risk AI systems: the route says whether the system is one.
